                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2b203451-2d33-39c8-b070-dd62a7c14045",
                        "entry_id": "dc89c800-28dc-3f4b-92b2-c3b684ebba7f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fan of American singer-songwriter and television personality Meghan Trainor (born 1993)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a7046ea-00dc-4449-b86b-05afaf75416f",
                                "sense_id": "2b203451-2d33-39c8-b070-dd62a7c14045",
                                "text": "Megatronz, check out Meghan Trainor's 'Lips Are Movin' video here, and get a behind-the-scenes look at the making of the vid below!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68501af5-a2c9-4368-a55a-4acf06b9bbca",
                                "sense_id": "2b203451-2d33-39c8-b070-dd62a7c14045",
                                "text": "The attention span of the #Megatrons, as Trainor has christened her fans, presumably falls somewhere between the six-second length of a Vine and the 15-second limit on an Instagram video."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f129f029-5f43-4e84-a99e-2eb776b3451c",
                                "sense_id": "2b203451-2d33-39c8-b070-dd62a7c14045",
                                "text": "But when L.A. Reid, CEO of Epic Records, heard “That Bass,” he fell in love with Meghan’s empowering, in-your-face lyrics—as did all her fans (hey, Megatronz!), who have clicked on her YouTube video roughly 500 million times."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "738b1903-e2bc-4215-8e9f-aa30fbd8408c",
                                "sense_id": "2b203451-2d33-39c8-b070-dd62a7c14045",
                                "text": "It was “Title” – which Trainor later deemed “the best song of the night” – that had the singer seemingly marvelling at her “Megatronz,” who sang the whole way through."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff2b22ba-527c-4d5b-91a3-b1ff44ab1ef5",
                                "sense_id": "2b203451-2d33-39c8-b070-dd62a7c14045",
                                "text": "From then on, it’s wall-to -all hits as she leads a full backing band and troupe of dancers, and has her ‘Megatrons’ – her largely pre-teen fanbase – in the palm of her hand."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4733aa05-8bf7-4742-8d48-7aeaffa1c70c",
                                "sense_id": "2b203451-2d33-39c8-b070-dd62a7c14045",
                                "text": "Lots of Megatronz may have missed this relationship, or fling if you want to call it, because it was so quick."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fa568fa-35bf-4883-9510-64eff6cb8783",
                                "sense_id": "2b203451-2d33-39c8-b070-dd62a7c14045",
                                "text": "It’s extremely clear that Trainor respects and loves her Megatrons as much as they do her."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0431d7f8-3c40-4331-9b3e-9655808abe4a",
                                "sense_id": "2b203451-2d33-39c8-b070-dd62a7c14045",
                                "text": "This is a major moment for us Megatronz! Our Grammy-winning icon is keeping us fed!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
